{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08957","headline":"杂体五首 一 · 韦应物","name":"杂体五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈匣中镜，爲此尘垢蚀。\n辉光何所如，月在云中黑。\n南金既雕错，鞶带共辉饰。\n空存鉴物名，坐使妍蚩惑。\n美人竭肝胆，思照冰玉色。\n自非磨莹工，日日空叹息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}